{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261109/photo/bkn-20261109065858253-1109_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261109072333\"/><p>私家車嚴重損毀。</p><p>葵涌發生交通意外。今日(9日)早上6時36分，一輛的士、一輛小巴及一輛私家車沿青山公路—葵涌段行駛，至近和宜合道交界時3車意外相撞，私家車泵把飛脫、左車頭及車身嚴重損毀，事件中一人受傷由救護車送院治理，現場有車輛洩漏汽油，消防到場戒備，人員灑上木糠清理路面油漬，並調查車禍原因。受事件影響，附近一帶交通受阻。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:21:57.683365+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":171,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T22:58:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T12:27:18.053409+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T10:15:45.159457+00:00","content_hash":"bcbfed0d056a6a85a952f023510aa24529d611b012309b01fa70b8415f26d9c3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:21:57.683365+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}